      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看来赏红叶是种很好的放松。但是，想要追上\n北部玄驹那欢快的步伐，却相当困难――",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b2cebd44abb9efc88f239a98606e1b845e945512992d20477ead83976d7e499",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
