    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dceb5cdcf4643e2fcf5f8e08",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且，在来这儿之前……那个，帮别人忙……\n都让训练员来干了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a802f3b482388e24abebba72fb1bf2bd7cef5ad23d1054821d061706eee3198f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c5bb072fa7b253dedd415fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹以惊人的气势跑走了。\n她比平时更有干劲，但同时也给我一种过于拼命的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f6b62dff830a93a1afcf112716675c97bd27f4e276a2fe04f2165d85d9ab268",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef68b44b5df3ddb83bbb3ea9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我很高兴能帮你的忙",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa87f35ad856823828b462ea354c652104508150a9627b747997e6563f35ba18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1068/storytimeline_041068006.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:960a5e44f3470e564077e558",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她在附近帮助别人，我在不妨碍别人的情况下帮忙\n也是理所当然。而且――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0fb56ce90f599e8fdea11f72511f5617deb936a959aeb9957c475aeb921ff9d",
